From fbaaeb0eefe49cd09ab5c8488eb3e214e283a5aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sankofa <sankofa@invalid>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:41:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] batch: add CronJob spec.scheduleSpread behind
 CronJobScheduleSpread

Adds an optional struct with maxDelaySeconds (1..86400) to CronJobSpec in
batch/v1 and batch/v1beta1, the alpha feature gate, validation, dropping of
the field while the gate is disabled, and generated code.

Signed-off-by: sankofa <sankofa@invalid>
Assisted-by: LLM
